{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalInstantonUnique","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalInstantonUnique","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Instanton"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalInstanton.unique_up_to_gauge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalInstanton.unique_up_to_gauge","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-unique.lean#L40-L63","doc":"**Uniqueness of categorical instantons (proved extensionality).**\n\nTwo `CategoricalInstanton C fh` instances with the same connection,\ncurvature, and Hodge involution are equal: the `self_dual` field is\npropositional.  This replaces a false\n`Subsingleton (CategoricalInstanton C fh)` axiom (free fields admit\ndistinct instances) with the extensionality the structure genuinely\nsupports; the gauge-quotient moduli statement is the open refactor\n(see the file docstring). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-instanton-unique","label":"prop:categorical-instanton-unique","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-unique.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}